    "question": "A set S contains 7 distinct elements. How many subsets does S have?",
    "options": {
      "A": "2⁷",
      "B": "7²",
      "C": "7!",
      "D": "2·7"
    },
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "explanation": "The power set of a set with n elements has 2ⁿ subsets. Here n = 7, so the number of subsets is 2⁷.",
    "difficulty": "Medium"
